    "what": "IETF composite ML-DSA test vector id-MLDSA65-ECDSA-P384-SHA512, copied VERBATIM (base64, as published). Only this one parameter set is kept, and the X.509 fields (x5c, sk_pkcs8) are dropped: nothing here parses certificates.",
